msgctxt "136"
msgid "Damn, you're good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Ready to go now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Leave him alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I said leave him alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Thanks, but I'm okay. See?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Really. You don't have to worry. Run along home now, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Who's that kid?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"We just ran into each other one day. Not sure who he is or\r\n"
"where he's from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"I have kids myself, you know. A boy and a girl. I bet\r\n"
"they're just about his size..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "What do you mean, you bet? Aren't they your kids?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"In my line of work, I can't be with them, no matter\r\n"
"how much I want to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "A friend's taking care of them now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "You sound bitter about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"I used to be in the yakuza, but my boss blamed me for a\r\n"
"mistake he made, and I got kicked out of the family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Back then, there wasn't anything like the HLA. I had a\r\n"
"hard time trying to find a job, and my wife died from\r\n"
"overworking herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"I needed money to feed my kids. This was the only kind\r\n"
"of work I could find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"I want to make sure I can send money to them, so I don't\r\n"
"spend money on myself for clothes or weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Hence the name Old Rags Hasutani."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"A part of the reason I joined the Reapers was because I was\r\n"
"angry about getting blamed for something I didn't do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"But mostly, it was because the Reapers took care of me\r\n"
"financially."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I'm betting your kids don't know you're in this line of\r\n"
"work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "There's no way I could tell them, but I need the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"If I have to get blood on my hands to feed my children,\r\n"
"then so be it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "That's what you say... but what if you get caught?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"If you keep this up and get arrested, what's going to happen\r\n"
"to your kids?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "And how would you be able to keep them from finding out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "You're right, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "It's not too late. You can try to find an honest job again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "The HLA and Ibuki can definitely help you out now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Nothing's ever that easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Things have changed since you were kicked out of your\r\n"
"family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Don't you think it's worth another try?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "...I think you're right. I'll give it another shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "You've opened my eyes. Thank you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"And then the teacher said she liked it! She said it looked\r\n"
"really good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Wow, that's great! That's my guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "And you know what else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"(That looks like the hitman Hasutani... He seems pretty\r\n"
"close to that kid.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Sorry to interrupt. Are you Hasutani?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Yeah, that's me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "You have a minute?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"I need to talk with this man here, so why don't you head on\r\n"
"home for today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Nooo! I wanna hang out with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"We'll see each other again tomorrow. Come on, now, off\r\n"
"you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "What did you want to talk to me about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"You're one of the Reaper hitmen, aren't you? Old Rags\r\n"
"Hasutani?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "The fact you know that nickname isn't a good sign, is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "The Honest Living Association sent me to come find you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "The HLA...? I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I'm afraid I can't afford to get caught. I\r\n"
"won't go without a fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"There's no need to fight over this. We're just gathering\r\n"
"information on the Reapers, and we want your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"Look, even I have my principles. Don't think I'd stoop that\r\n"
"low."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "If you want me to go with you, you'll have to make me!"
msgstr ""

